          "title": "Chemoproteomic profiling of  <i>Plasmodium falciparum</i>  Hsp90 inhibition reveals functional link to DNA replication pathways",
          "authorString": "Ibrasheva G, Chen Y, Chirgwin ME, Hughes CJ, Fitzgerald MC, Derbyshire ER.",
